    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/extras/6b762d94a9c70c3e624c2247a4fe2cb8.avif?t=1749472880\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in an old Cold War submarine. Your only goal: survive. Complete urgent repairs, manage limited resources, and keep the systems running. You can\u2019t see each other. One misstep, one wrong call, and it\u2019s all over.\u2028</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your voice. Trust your partner. And don't run out of time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/extras/598489776f53dc9c1a348e8c1dd4b97f.avif?t=1749472880\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll never make it alone. Communicate through a crackling walkie-talkie. One speaks, the other listens - no exceptions. Relay codes, fix malfunctions, and guide each other through a maze of rust, steam, and shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2028<strong>Forget clear sight. All you\u2019ve got is each other\u2019s voice. Keep it steady.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/extras/abd1fa616ce87141e7eaee39848e1b9e.avif?t=1749472880\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is not your friend. Each second wasted brings your doom closer - flooding compartments, failing engines, failing minds. Complete your tasks quickly. Stay calm under pressure. And if you mess up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ll hear it. Feel it. Maybe even see it... before the ocean swallows you whole.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/extras/6b762d94a9c70c3e624c2247a4fe2cb8.avif?t=1749472880\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in an old Cold War submarine. Your only goal: survive. Complete urgent repairs, manage limited resources, and keep the systems running. You can\u2019t see each other. One misstep, one wrong call, and it\u2019s all over.\u2028</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your voice. Trust your partner. And don't run out of time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/extras/598489776f53dc9c1a348e8c1dd4b97f.avif?t=1749472880\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll never make it alone. Communicate through a crackling walkie-talkie. One speaks, the other listens - no exceptions. Relay codes, fix malfunctions, and guide each other through a maze of rust, steam, and shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2028<strong>Forget clear sight. All you\u2019ve got is each other\u2019s voice. Keep it steady.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/extras/abd1fa616ce87141e7eaee39848e1b9e.avif?t=1749472880\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is not your friend. Each second wasted brings your doom closer - flooding compartments, failing engines, failing minds. Complete your tasks quickly. Stay calm under pressure. And if you mess up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ll hear it. Feel it. Maybe even see it... before the ocean swallows you whole.</strong></p>",
